\subsection{Validation Summary}
The coupled GR--hydrodynamic solver preserves constraint invariants,
maintains shock fidelity within two grid cells, and exhibits near-ideal
fourth-order convergence. Gauge evolution remains stable under dynamic
lapse collapse without coordinate breakdown.